yrnd Fortran translation
========================

The original R package yrnd was written by William Arrata and is distributed
under GPL-3. This translation preserves that license. The original package
sources are retained under original/yrnd-master for attribution and review.

The bundled tvm Fortran dependency is a separate MIT-licensed work. Its own
LICENSE and NOTICE files remain in dependencies/tvm-fortran.

The Bloomberg retrieval helpers require Bloomberg Terminal/API access and the
Rblpapi R package. They are external data-interface routines, not portable
numerical algorithms, and are intentionally not translated.
